/MARK12
	DEC-12-YITA
	 
	MARK12 A FORMATING AND
	VERIFICATION PROGRAM FOR
	UNCERTIFIED TAPES
	   (VERSION 0)
	 
	STARTING PROCEDURE
	IF THE VERSION OF DIAL USED
	DOES NOT AUTOMATICALLY START
	THAN MARK12 IS STARTED BY THE
	FOLLOWING PROCEDURE:
	 
	1. BE SURE PROSCESSOR IS STOPPE;
	MOMENTARILY PRESS THE STOP
	SWITCH IF NECESSARY.
	 
	2. PRESS I-O PRESET WITH THE
	MODE SWITCH SET TO LINC.
	 
	3. PRESS START 20.
	 
	 
	-	-	-	-	-	--	
	 
	 
