RELAYTST
	12-D8AB
	 
	PDP-12 RELAY REGISTER TEST
	 
	3 PART PROG
	 
	RELAY FLIP FLOP REG TEST
	A. 8 MODE
	B. IF=0 DF=0
	C. IO PRESET
	 
	RSW TO RELAY TST
	A. L MODE
	B. IO PRESET
	C. LSW=1000
	D. ST LS
	E. RSW=0011
	F. ALTER RSW6-11 DATA SHOULD AP-PEAR IN BOTH RELAY REG LAMPS AND AC
